      "heading": "The landlord and agent problem",
      "html": "<p>Landlords and agents with many properties want records in their inbox the same day.</p><p>On paper, the form goes in a folder. The office scans it later. The landlord asks two days after. Agents notice who is quick. Over 80 properties, that becomes a contract.</p><p>Digital records also show a landlord which of 20 properties are due for renewal.</p>"
