      "heading": "Commissioning forms, often incomplete",
      "html": "<p>The commissioning form is a warranty document. Without it, the warranty may not hold.</p><p>It needs many readings: gas rate, pressure, combustion analysis, flow and return temperatures, flue terminal. On a busy install day, it gets cut short.</p><p>With Quickler you send each reading as you take it. Each is timestamped. The form is written from that. You rewrite nothing.</p>"
    },
