      "html": "<p>Each gas record is its own WhatsApp conversation. You answer the questions as you work. Voice notes are written out. Say \"flue CO 38ppm, within tolerance\" at the terminal, and it is recorded.</p><p>When you say done, the CP12, service record, commissioning form or breakdown report is written. Send the PDF to the landlord, agent or customer.</p><p>The dashboard shows every open and finished record. No new app. No extra logins. See <a href=\"/pages/cp12-gas-safety-software-uk.html\">CP12 gas safety software</a>, <a href=\"/pages/cp12-report-template-uk.html\">CP12 report template</a> and <a href=\"/pages/digital-signature-field-reports-uk.html\">digital signatures for field reports</a>.</p>"
